WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:02.085
She may just be
20 years old,

00:00:02.169 --> 00:00:05.047
but Isabela Merced
is already a huge star,

00:00:05.464 --> 00:00:08.008
and her career
is just getting started.

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:10.928
To celebrate her star turn
in Netflix's Sweet Girl,

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:13.138
let's take a look at
the roles that got her here,

00:00:13.222 --> 00:00:14.890
in her Road to Netflix...

00:00:17.768 --> 00:00:20.270
The acting bug hit Isabela
from a young age,

00:00:20.354 --> 00:00:23.315
making her Broadway debut
at just 10 years old

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:25.901
in a production of Evita,
alongside Ricky Martin.

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:29.905
Her TV acting career began
picking up steam in 2013,

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:31.198
when she had
a recurring role

00:00:31.281 --> 00:00:33.909
in NBC's family sitcom,
Growing Up Fisher.

00:00:34.493 --> 00:00:35.369
Your dad didn't tell you?

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:37.579
My mum's out of town
for work

00:00:37.663 --> 00:00:39.248
so I'm going to Catalina
with you guys.

00:00:39.331 --> 00:00:42.167
And in 2014, she had
a recurring voice role

00:00:42.251 --> 00:00:44.461
on Dora and Friends:
Into the City!

00:00:44.545 --> 00:00:46.880
A sequel to the original
children's series.

00:00:46.964 --> 00:00:49.716
I'm Kate and these are
my friends, Dora and Pablo.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.177
But her breakthrough role
came in 2014,

00:00:52.261 --> 00:00:55.264
on Nickelodeon's 100 Things
to Do Before High School,

00:00:55.347 --> 00:00:57.516
where she played
middle schooler CJ Martin,

00:00:57.599 --> 00:00:59.309
who, along with
her two best friends,

00:00:59.393 --> 00:01:00.936
makes a bucket list
filled with things

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:02.563
to accomplish
before high school.

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:04.857
I just want to say,

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:07.192
I am not proud
of what I'm about to do.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:10.696
She also appeared in other
Nickelodeon productions,

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:12.531
including 2015's
Splitting Adam

00:01:12.614 --> 00:01:15.617
and 2016's Legends
of the Hidden Temple.

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:19.746
This is a restricted area,
I'm putting my foot down.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:21.206
Also that year, she played

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:24.418
the super-smart president
of a middle school AV club,

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:26.795
Gene, in Middle School:
The Worst Years of My Life,

00:01:27.379 --> 00:01:30.215
an adaptation of the 2011
novel of the same name.

00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:31.884
I just love that someone has
the guts

00:01:31.967 --> 00:01:32.926
to take on
the establishment.

00:01:33.594 --> 00:01:35.971
By 2017, Isabela was
on the big screen

00:01:36.054 --> 00:01:37.723
in the fifth instalment

00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:38.849
of the Transformers
film series,

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:40.684
alongside Mark Wahlberg

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:43.061
and fellow Netflix alum,
Laura Haddock.

00:01:43.145 --> 00:01:45.189
Her character,
Izabella with a Z,

00:01:45.272 --> 00:01:47.482
is a young orphaned
scavenger on Earth,

00:01:47.566 --> 00:01:50.152
whose only companions
are two autobots.

00:01:50.235 --> 00:01:52.613
I want to stay
and I want to fight them.

00:01:52.696 --> 00:01:54.698
Transformers director,
Michael Bay, gave her

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:57.534
the opportunity to add a few
Spanish words to her part,

00:01:57.618 --> 00:01:59.119
after hearing her
speak Spanish

00:01:59.203 --> 00:02:00.370
with her mother on set.

00:02:00.454 --> 00:02:02.915
That year was
definitely busy for her.

00:02:02.998 --> 00:02:05.000
She also appeared
in the hugely popular

00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:06.210
Kingdom Hearts series,

00:02:06.293 --> 00:02:08.212
voicing Ava
in the English dub.

00:02:08.295 --> 00:02:09.671
And what's written
in the book...

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:12.466
all of it will happen.

00:02:12.549 --> 00:02:15.469
2018's
Sicario: Day of the Soldado

00:02:15.552 --> 00:02:18.013
brought a meteor role
and change in genre

00:02:18.096 --> 00:02:19.097
to Isabela's resume,

00:02:19.181 --> 00:02:21.183
when she played the daughter
of a drug kingpin

00:02:21.266 --> 00:02:22.518
in the action crime sequel.

00:02:23.477 --> 00:02:24.353
I know who you are.

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:27.814
You're the attorney
whose family they killed.

00:02:27.898 --> 00:02:31.193
Her character, Isabel,
is captured by a CIA team

00:02:31.276 --> 00:02:33.654
aiming to start a war
between drug cartels

00:02:33.737 --> 00:02:35.155
on the US/Mexico border.

00:02:35.239 --> 00:02:37.199
She was reunited
with Mark Wahlberg

00:02:37.282 --> 00:02:39.952
in 2018's Instant Family,
a comedy drama

00:02:40.035 --> 00:02:42.371
where a couple decide
to adopt three siblings.

00:02:42.454 --> 00:02:45.541
Isabela played 15-year-old
Izzy, the eldest sibling,

00:02:45.624 --> 00:02:47.543
who is initially
not on board

00:02:47.626 --> 00:02:48.752
with the whole
adoption thing.

00:02:48.836 --> 00:02:50.254
Just let me talk to her,
please,

00:02:50.337 --> 00:02:53.048
and then we can figure
something out and...

00:02:53.131 --> 00:02:55.217
-Honey…
-...she can take me home.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:57.052
Remember how
Isabela had a voice role

00:02:57.135 --> 00:02:58.512
in the Dora series?

00:02:58.595 --> 00:03:01.390
Well, she stepped it up
in 2019 by taking on

00:03:01.473 --> 00:03:03.642
the lead role
in the live action version,

00:03:03.725 --> 00:03:05.477
Dora and the Lost City
of Gold,

00:03:05.561 --> 00:03:07.271
playing a grown-up version

00:03:07.354 --> 00:03:08.939
of the iconic
children's character.

00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:11.024
The movie sees Dora
head to high school,

00:03:11.108 --> 00:03:13.318
a far cry
from her explorer roots.

00:03:13.402 --> 00:03:15.487
That is until she
and her friends are captured

00:03:15.571 --> 00:03:18.657
by mercenaries trying
to steal treasures in Peru.

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:20.075
Oh, and there's another

00:03:20.158 --> 00:03:21.326
Mark Wahlberg
connection here.

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:24.663
His nephew Jeff Wahlberg
play Diego in the film.

00:03:24.746 --> 00:03:27.583
Cousin Diego!
You're so skinny and tall!

00:03:28.083 --> 00:03:29.960
You are way more energetic
than I remember.

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:32.462
Her first appearance
on a Netflix Original

00:03:32.546 --> 00:03:33.589
also came that year

00:03:33.672 --> 00:03:36.300
in the Christmas romcom,
Let It Snow.

00:03:36.383 --> 00:03:37.676
Snow hides a lot

00:03:37.759 --> 00:03:39.052
It's like the space
of weather.

00:03:39.636 --> 00:03:41.221
You can do a lot worse
than this place, trust me.

00:03:41.305 --> 00:03:43.182
Isabela's character Julie
is a girl

00:03:43.265 --> 00:03:45.017
who has a scholarship
to Columbia,

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:46.643
but feels like
she can't leave her mother,

00:03:46.727 --> 00:03:47.561
who is ill.

00:03:47.644 --> 00:03:49.479
She and a rising pop star

00:03:49.563 --> 00:03:51.732
strike up a
will they-won't they romance

00:03:51.815 --> 00:03:53.525
when they meet on a train
which get stopped

00:03:53.609 --> 00:03:55.068
by snowed over tracks.

00:03:55.152 --> 00:03:56.987
That brings us to 2021,

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.864
when she made
a return to voice acting,

00:03:58.947 --> 00:04:01.700
in Dreamworks Animation's
Spirit Untamed.

00:04:01.783 --> 00:04:02.868
I'm going to call you
Spirit.

00:04:05.746 --> 00:04:08.832
And of course she stars
alongside Jason Momoa

00:04:08.916 --> 00:04:10.209
in Netflix's Sweet Girl.

00:04:10.292 --> 00:04:12.753
This is a tale of a man
and his daughter

00:04:12.836 --> 00:04:15.506
versus some shady
pharmaceutical companies.

00:04:15.589 --> 00:04:17.925
Ray, played by Jason,
is devastated

00:04:18.008 --> 00:04:19.510
when his wife dies
of terminal cancer,

00:04:19.593 --> 00:04:21.678
shortly after
a life-saving drug

00:04:21.762 --> 00:04:23.096
is pulled from the market.

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:25.641
But his quest for revenge
on the company responsible

00:04:25.724 --> 00:04:28.393
lands him and his daughter,
played by Isabela,

00:04:28.477 --> 00:04:30.062
in a whole load of trouble.

00:04:30.479 --> 00:04:31.480
Dad!

00:04:32.064 --> 00:04:34.233
And Isabela's Rachel
isn't taking any

00:04:34.316 --> 00:04:35.484
of this lying down.

00:04:35.567 --> 00:04:37.069
I know you're fighting
for us.

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:40.113
But this is my fight too.

00:04:40.781 --> 00:04:43.075
She joins her father
in the fight for justice.

00:04:43.158 --> 00:04:44.493
And what happens next?

00:04:44.576 --> 00:04:46.453
Well, you'll have to catch
Sweet Girl,

00:04:46.537 --> 00:04:48.330
now streaming on Netflix.

00:04:48.413 --> 00:04:50.207
And for more on your
favourite Netflix stars,

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:52.501
make sure you subscribe
to the channel.

